### Page 6 of 19

```text
Park Plan - Entire Complex
Mynear Street at Ridge Road
Cheyenne SC is working closely with the City to develop a community
resource with planned Park renovations, implementing a phased approach
for the Park plans.
Phase Breakdown
●
Phase 1: Indoor Complex
●
Phase 2: Renovations to & expansion of existing outdoor infrastructure
A Capital Campaign plan and timeline has been professionally prepared by
Cogeo,  a nationally recognized fundraising and capital campaign consulting
ﬁrm.
Based on their expertise, planning study analysis and results, and experience
in the sector, they have recommended implementing a phased approach,
beginning with the Indoor Complex.
